  "label": "Comedy Joke Structure: Setup and Punchline",
  "description": "The meme follows a classic comedic structure: a setup ('I remember when your mom dropped you off to school') followed by a punchline ('she got a fine for littering'). Understanding this structure is necessary to appreciate the humor, as the punchline relies on the contrast between the mundane setup and the absurd punchline. This is a fundamental concept in stand-up comedy and is not visible in the image but is essential to interpreting the meme’s intent.",
